# Dataset Considerations:
# Large CSV dataset (8.4 MB) is excluded from version control to maintain a lightweight repository.
# The data/ directory structure is preserved via data/.gitkeep.
# To obtain the dataset, download healthcare_dataset.csv from Kaggle (details in README.md).
# If you wish to commit the CSV directly, comment out the line below.
data/*.csv
